  "Description": {
    "Cost": 7645005,
    "UIName": "Turkina",
    "Id": "chassisdef_turkina_TKR-MCA",
    "Name": "Turkina",
    "Details": "The MC/A loadout was created as part of the 'Master Creation' project, an attempt to have the best warriors create their ideal configurations. The MC/A combines four LBX, two of them being AC/10 and two AC/2, together with two ER Large Lasers as the main damage dealers. A Medium Pulse Laser and LRM-5 can be used if some extra punch is needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
